    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. that makes sense. one more thing though—sometimes it feels like there are certain people who just seem to thrive on causing chaos or being difficult on purpose, almost like they're trying to undermine the whole team structure. how should i approach documenting those types of \"bad actor\" behaviors specifically? is there a way to frame it so it doesn't just look like a personality clash?",
