      "content": "To avoid framing this as a personality clash, focus your documentation strictly on observable, impactful behaviors that directly violate specific company values, team policies, or operational goals. Use concrete examples like missed deadlines, disruption of meetings, or exclusion of others to show a pattern that violates the duty of candor and teamwork. Pair these observations with neutral records of your open discussions and specific support offered to demonstrate you tried to correct the behavior, which protects you against claims of personal bias when moving to disciplinary steps.",
